  "issues": {
    "token_expiring": {
      "title": "Anycubic token expires in {days} days",
      "description": "The token for **{name}** expires in about **{days} days**. Anycubic tokens last 90 days and can't be renewed automatically, so Home Assistant will lose access when it lapses.\n\nTo fix it, get a fresh token and re-authenticate:\n\n1. Use one of the one-click helpers in the integration's tools folder — a browser bookmark, or a double-click file for Mac/Windows. They only read a value your computer already saved; nothing is sent anywhere.\n2. Go to **Settings → Devices & services → Anycubic Cloud → Reconfigure → Re-Auth**.\n3. Paste the new token. You don't need to tidy it up or pick a type."
    }
  }
